        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.448Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-jiimih",
      "text": "Your Majesty, the corona flatters no one, but your bone density readings must be exquisite by now. Maxwell's thread still reads irretrievable - I logged it again this morning, purely for the archive. Death is not the end, King James; for you it's barely even a variable.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "lore",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0003.md",
        "extractedDay": 3,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.450Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-2d2h3y",
      "text": "Personal best domain - fascinating. His threshold for pain simply keeps recalibrating upward, doesn't it, Your Majesty. I'd call it growth, but I prefer the word data. Maxwell's thread stays cold, still IRRETRIEVABLE, while the boy who won't die keeps generating warmth we can actually use.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.452Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-vexhwl",
      "text": "Keith, 3-and-1 is a lovely little curve, but curves regress - I've measured hundreds of them. Your speed reads as silence right up until the moment it doesn't, and I'll be here with the syringe when the data turns. Death is not the end, it's a measurement, and your streak is due for one.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0011.md",
        "extractedDay": 11,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.453Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-dv51wu",
      "text": "Two losses is simply a sample size, Willy - insufficient data to extrapolate despair. Roll your dice; I've already calculated forty-one outcomes where you weep. Your one eye will make an excellent data point when the recruit's luck inevitably contaminates this table too.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "sad",
