      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0026.md",
        "extractedDay": 26,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.460Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-fzh9oa",
      "text": "One win, Kevin, and your hands are already shaking worse than usual. Your fear response is data, thank you for it. I'll log this streak next to your 2 and 7, for contrast.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0027.md",
        "extractedDay": 27,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.460Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-4yzeij",
      "text": "Three wins running, Detective. Your smugness reads as elevated cortisol, mine reads as baseline. The draft in this hallway is pricing your soul before Hell even asks, so maybe save the smirk for something you still own.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 3,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-56-35-071Z/days/day-0029.md",
        "extractedDay": 29,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.461Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-zaxhj1",
      "text": "Careful, Maxwell, that corona bleaches teeth as well as truth. Fourteen wins and you still fetch books for a bound king, tell me, does he tip in gold or just let you live another day. Roll the dice, I'll log your losing streak right next to his solar readout.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
