        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.465Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-dr-voss-uwa7yv",
      "text": "Willy, your smug is showing, and I have not even rolled yet. Your one eye tracks my dice like the recruit tracks his own death, eager and doomed. Let's see if your streak survives contact with my data.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "dr-voss",
        "name": "Dr. Voss",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
